    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Institute for Human Development, IHD is promoting advocacy efforts geared towards supporting Community Health Volunteers, CHVs. Through a conference that brought together local and regional organisations that support Early Childhood Development interventions, the Institute held discussions around policy recommendations for community health volunteers.",
